{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "创建视频生成任务",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "提交视频生成任务，支持文生视频和图生视频。\n\n返回任务 ID，可通过 GET 接口查询任务状态。\n"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "视频（Videos）"
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "使用 Bearer Token 认证。\n格式: `Authorization: Bearer sk-xxxxxx`\n"
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/v1/video/generations": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "视频（Videos）"
        ],
        "summary": "创建视频生成任务",
        "description": "提交视频生成任务，支持文生视频和图生视频。\n\n返回任务 ID，可通过 GET 接口查询任务状态。\n",
        "operationId": "createvideogeneration",
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "视频生成请求",
                "properties": {
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "模型 ID",
                    "examples": [
                      "doubao-seedance-2-0-260128"
                    ]
                  },
                  "prompt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "文本描述提示词",
                    "examples": [
                      "宇航员站起身走了"
                    ]
                  },
                  "image": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "单张图片输入（URL 或 Base64），图生视频时使用。\n\n与 `images[0]` 等价，两者同时传时优先取 `image`。",
                    "examples": [
                      "https://example.com/image.jpg"
                    ]
                  },
                  "images": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "description": "多张图片/视频 URL 数组，用于多素材输入场景：\n- `happyhorse-1.0-i2v`（图生视频）：传 1 个元素，为首帧图片 URL\n- `happyhorse-1.0-r2v`（参考视频生成）：传 1 个或多个参考图片 URL\n- `happyhorse-1.0-video-edit`（视频编辑）：`images[0]` 为待编辑视频 URL，`images[1:]` 为参考图片 URL（可选）",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "examples": [
                      [
                        "https://example.com/frame.jpg"
                      ]
                    ]
                  },
                  "input_reference": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "参考媒体 URL。`happyhorse-1.0-i2v` 图生视频时可用此字段传入首帧图片，与 `images[0]` 等价，优先级高于 `images[0]`。",
                    "examples": [
                      "https://example.com/reference.jpg"
                    ]
                  },
                  "duration": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "视频时长（秒）",
                    "examples": [
                      5
                    ]
                  },
                  "size": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "输出分辨率。支持两种格式：\n- `宽x高`（如 `\"1920x1080\"`）：自动推导分辨率档位和宽高比，优先级高于 metadata.resolution/ratio\n- 分辨率档位（如 `\"1080p\"`）：仅设置分辨率，宽高比由 metadata.ratio 或上游默认值决定\n\n豆包 Seedance 支持的档位：`480p`、`720p`、`1080p`（Fast/Mini 不支持）、`4K`（仅 2.0 支持）",
                    "examples": [
                      "1920x1080",
                      "720x1280",
                      "1080p"
                    ]
                  },
                  "seed": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "description": "随机种子",
                    "examples": [
                      20231234
                    ]
                  },
                  "n": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "description": "生成视频数量",
                    "examples": [
                      1
                    ]
                  },
                  "response_format": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "响应格式",
                    "examples": [
                      "url"
                    ]
                  },
                  "user": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "用户标识",
                    "examples": [
                      "user-1234"
                    ]
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "description": "渠道专属扩展参数，按需传入。不同渠道支持的子字段不同，未列出的字段将被忽略。\n\n**豆包 Seedance 系列（`doubao-seedance-*`）：**\n- `resolution` (string)：输出分辨率，可选值 `\"480P\"`、`\"720P\"`、`\"1080P\"`、`\"4K\"`（影响计费）\n- `ratio` (string)：宽高比，如 `\"16:9\"`、`\"9:16\"`\n- `generate_audio` (boolean)：是否生成音频，`true` 为有声视频，`false` 为无声视频（影响 seedance-1-5-pro 计费）\n- `return_last_frame` (boolean)：是否同时返回最后一帧图片\n- `camera_fixed` (boolean)：是否固定镜头\n- `watermark` (boolean)：是否添加水印\n- `draft` (boolean)：草稿模式，生成速度更快但质量较低\n- `service_tier` (string)：服务等级\n- `content` (array)：多模态输入内容，视频生成（i2v）时可传入 `video_url` 类型条目\n\n**HappyHorse 系列（`happyhorse-*`）：**\n- `ratio` (string)：宽高比，如 `\"16:9\"`、`\"9:16\"`、`\"1:1\"`。仅 t2v、r2v 支持；i2v 宽高比跟随首帧图片，video-edit 跟随输入视频\n- `audio_setting` (string)：音频处理方式，仅 video-edit 支持，如 `\"mute\"`（静音）\n",
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "properties": {
                      "resolution": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "输出分辨率档位（豆包 Seedance 系列）。推荐使用外层 `size` 字段代替，`size` 优先级更高且同时支持推导宽高比。",
                        "examples": [
                          "1080p"
                        ]
                      },
                      "ratio": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "宽高比。豆包 Seedance 系列：若外层 `size` 使用 `宽x高` 格式，宽高比会自动推导，无需单独传此字段。HappyHorse t2v / r2v：支持，i2v / video-edit 不支持。",
                        "examples": [
                          "16:9"
                        ]
                      },
                      "generate_audio": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "是否生成音频（豆包 Seedance 系列，影响 seedance-1-5-pro 计费）",
                        "examples": [
                          true
                        ]
                      },
                      "return_last_frame": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "是否返回最后一帧图片（豆包 Seedance 系列）"
                      },
                      "camera_fixed": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "是否固定镜头（豆包 Seedance 系列）"
                      },
                      "watermark": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "是否添加水印（豆包 Seedance 系列）"
                      },
                      "draft": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "草稿模式（豆包 Seedance 系列）"
                      },
                      "service_tier": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "服务等级（豆包 Seedance 系列）"
                      },
                      "content": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "description": "多模态输入内容（豆包 Seedance 系列，视频生成时传入）",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "type": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "内容类型，如 \"video_url\"、\"image_url\"、\"text\""
                            },
                            "video_url": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "url": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "description": "视频 URL"
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "audio_setting": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "音频处理方式（HappyHorse video-edit 专用）。可选值：`\"mute\"`（静音输出）",
                        "examples": [
                          "mute"
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "x-apifox-orders": [
                      "resolution",
                      "ratio",
                      "generate_audio",
                      "return_last_frame",
                      "camera_fixed",
                      "watermark",
                      "draft",
                      "service_tier",
                      "content",
                      "audio_setting"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "x-apifox-orders": [
                  "model",
                  "prompt",
                  "image",
                  "images",
                  "input_reference",
                  "duration",
                  "size",
                  "seed",
                  "n",
                  "response_format",
                  "user",
                  "metadata"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "doubao-seedance-2-0": {
                  "summary": "doubao seedance 2.0 多模态视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-2-0-fast-260128",
                    "prompt": "Use the first-person POV framing from Video 1 throughout, and use Audio 1 as the background music throughout. First-person POV fruit tea promotional ad, Seedance brand limited-edition apple fruit tea; opening frame is Image 1, your hand picks a dew-covered Aksu red apple, a light, crisp apple tapping sound; 2–4 seconds: fast cuts, your hand drops apple chunks into a shaker, adds ice and tea base, shakes forcefully, ice clinking and shaking sounds sync with upbeat rhythmic beats, background audio: {Fresh-cut, shaken fresh}; 4–6 seconds: first-person close-up of the finished drink, layered fruit tea is poured into a clear cup, your hand gently squeezes milk foam to spread across the top, a pink brand sticker is applied to the cup, the camera moves closer to show the layered textures of the foam and fruit tea; 6–8 seconds: first-person hand-held toast shot, you raise the fruit tea from Image 2 toward the camera (simulating handing it to the viewer), the cup label is clearly visible, background audio {Take a sip of fresh refreshment}, the final frame freezes on Image 2. All background voice audio uses a female voice.",
                    "size": "1920x1080",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "seed": 20240303,
                    "metadata": {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "image_url",
                          "image_url": {
                            "url": "https://ark-doc.tos-ap-southeast-1.bytepluses.com/doc_image/r2v_tea_pic1.jpg"
                          },
                          "role": "reference_image"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "image_url",
                          "image_url": {
                            "url": "https://ark-doc.tos-ap-southeast-1.bytepluses.com/doc_image/r2v_tea_pic2.jpg"
                          },
                          "role": "reference_image"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "video_url",
                          "video_url": {
                            "url": "https://ark-doc.tos-ap-southeast-1.bytepluses.com/doc_video/r2v_tea_video1.mp4"
                          },
                          "role": "reference_video"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "audio_url",
                          "audio_url": {
                            "url": "https://ark-doc.tos-ap-southeast-1.bytepluses.com/doc_audio/r2v_tea_audio1.mp3"
                          },
                          "role": "reference_audio"
                        }
                      ],
                      "generate_audio": true,
                      "watermark": false,
                      "camera_fixed": false,
                      "return_last_frame": false,
                      "draft": false
                    }
                  }
                },
                "doubao-seedance-2-0-fast": {
                  "summary": "doubao seedance 2.0 fast",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-2-0-fast-260128",
                    "prompt": "宇航员在月球表面缓缓行走，远处是蓝色地球，星空背景",
                    "size": "1920x1080",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "seed": 20240303,
                    "metadata": {
                      "generate_audio": true,
                      "watermark": false,
                      "camera_fixed": false,
                      "return_last_frame": false,
                      "draft": false
                    }
                  }
                },
                "doubao-seedance-1-5-pro": {
                  "summary": "doubao seedance 1.5 pro",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seedance-1-5-pro",
                    "prompt": "人物转过头微笑，背景轻微虚化",
                    "size": "720x1280",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "metadata": {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "image_url",
                          "image_url": {
                            "url": "https://example.com/portrait.jpg"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "generate_audio": false,
                      "watermark": false,
                      "return_last_frame": true
                    }
                  }
                },
                "happyhorse-1-0-t2v": {
                  "summary": "happyhorse-1.0-t2v 文生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "happyhorse-1.0-t2v",
                    "prompt": "一座由硬纸板和瓶盖搭建的微型城市，在夜晚焕发出生机，小灯点缀其间，照亮前路",
                    "size": "1080p",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "seed": 20240101,
                    "metadata": {
                      "ratio": "16:9"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "happyhorse-1-0-i2v": {
                  "summary": "happyhorse-1.0-i2v 图生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "happyhorse-1.0-i2v",
                    "prompt": "小猫慢慢睁开眼睛，环顾四周，轻轻伸了个懒腰",
                    "image": "https://example.com/cat.jpg",
                    "size": "720p",
                    "duration": 5
                  }
                },
                "happyhorse-1-0-r2v": {
                  "summary": "happyhorse-1.0-r2v 参考生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "happyhorse-1.0-r2v",
                    "prompt": "保持角色风格，让她在花海中奔跑，裙摆飘动",
                    "images": [
                      "https://example.com/character-ref1.jpg",
                      "https://example.com/character-ref2.jpg"
                    ],
                    "size": "720p",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "seed": 20240202,
                    "metadata": {
                      "ratio": "9:16"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "happyhorse-1-0-video-edit": {
                  "summary": "happyhorse-1.0-video-edit 视频编辑",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "happyhorse-1.0-video-edit",
                    "prompt": "将视频中的白天场景替换为夜晚霓虹灯风格，保留人物动作不变",
                    "images": [
                      "https://example.com/source-video.mp4",
                      "https://example.com/style-ref.jpg"
                    ],
                    "metadata": {
                      "audio_setting": "mute"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功创建视频生成任务",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "description": "视频生成任务提交响应",
                  "properties": {
                    "task_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "任务 ID",
                      "examples": [
                        "abcd1234efgh"
                      ]
                    },
                    "status": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "任务状态",
                      "examples": [
                        "queued"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "x-apifox-orders": [
                    "task_id",
                    "status"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "错误信息"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "错误类型"
                        },
                        "param": {
                          "type": [
                            "string",
                            "null"
                          ],
                          "description": "相关参数"
                        },
                        "code": {
                          "type": [
                            "string",
                            "null"
                          ],
                          "description": "错误代码"
                        }
                      },
                      "x-apifox-orders": [
                        "message",
                        "type",
                        "param",
                        "code"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "x-apifox-orders": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}